silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_08_joc_and_regression_sections_01_joc_clause_by_clause_concrete_anchor_9_microchipidentifies#microchip_identifies silm:hasLongDescription "The microchip_identifies is the microchip-reader typed arrow identifying Mittens by id, NOT replacing the apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'microchip_identifies', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
